# ===== Claude Code (local runtime state) =====
# Ignore the whole .claude dir: it holds per-machine state only — local
# settings, scheduled-task locks, worktrees, and a skills symlink pointing
# into a local path (a dead link anywhere else, including GitHub). Add an
# exception (e.g. !.claude/settings.json) if you later share project config.
.claude/

# ===== Local docs (superpowers workflow) =====
# Design specs / implementation plans are kept locally only, not committed.
docs/superpowers/
